Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 14:24:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(ai): use real bundled ids in #1617 dynamic-refresh
 regression tests

The synthetic id minimax-m3-future had no bundled reference, so the
/v1/models refresh tests took the !reference fallback and returned
openai-completions defaults regardless of the models.json entries
flipped in the previous commit. Use the actual Zen id (minimax-m3-free)
and Go id (minimax-m3) so the tests exercise references.get(defaults.id)
and catch a regression in the bundled config or dynamic-refresh path.

Refs #1617
